00496 {\cf20 // OpenGL3 Render function.}\par
00497 {\cf20 // Note that this implementation is little overcomplicated because we are saving/setting up/restoring every OpenGL state explicitly.}\par
00498 {\cf20 // This is in order to be able to run within an OpenGL engine that doesn't do so.}\par
00499 {\cf18 void}    ImGui_ImplOpenGL3_RenderDrawData(ImDrawData* draw_data)\par
00500 \{\par
