00049 {\cf20 // - TableUpdateLayout() [Internal]             followup to BeginTable(): setup everything: widths, columns positions, clipping rectangles. Automatically called by the FIRST call to TableNextRow() or TableHeadersRow().}\par
00050 {\cf20 //    | TableSetupDrawChannels()                - setup ImDrawList channels}\par
00051 {\cf20 //    | TableUpdateBorders()                    - detect hovering columns for resize, ahead of contents submission}\par
00052 {\cf20 //    | TableBeginContextMenuPopup()}\par
