01719 {\cf20 // Return the cell rectangle based on currently known height.}\par
01720 {\cf20 // - Important: we generally don't know our row height until the end of the row, so Max.y will be incorrect in many situations.}\par
01721 {\cf20 //   The only case where this is correct is if we provided a min_row_height to TableNextRow() and don't go below it, or in TableEndRow() when we locked that height.}\par
01722 {\cf20 // - Important: if ImGuiTableFlags_PadOuterX is set but ImGuiTableFlags_PadInnerX is not set, the outer-most left and right}\par
01723 {\cf20 //   columns report a small offset so their CellBgRect can extend up to the outer border.}\par
